    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "SAFE is a comprehensive suite of safety games that the driver and passengers can each play to entertain themselves and up their safety factor. SAFE consists of games that test the safety, skill, and ecofriendliness of the driver. With games such as the Safe game, Green game, Carpooling game, Parking game, and Concentration game, SAFE helps you build all types of good driving habits. The SAFE games are integrated within the car’s interface and technology, so all a user has to do is use a GPS like device to select which game (s)he would like to play. Using a simple and familiar device, the user can not only select which game they would like to play, but also which of their friends they would like to challenge to a game. SAFE also comes with an social networking interface to challenge your friends in games and show off your achievements to other drivers on your bumper.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
